From 717c3c79f6f56028b2ddcc60871c35127405b20d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bsp2020 <bsp2020@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 12:32:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] GDN direct conv also writes the recurrent snapshot tails:
 the CONCAT and the snapshot CPYs launch nothing (2 fewer launches per GDN
 layer where the direct conv runs). Taken only when nothing between the CONCAT
 and the conv writes over state / x or touches a snapshot destination, and the
 destinations are disjoint; the batched-copy run stops at a folded snapshot
 CPY. Bit-identical. GGML_CUDA_DISABLE_GDN_CONV_SNAP=1 off

---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/cpy-batch.cu          |   2 +
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/gdn-conv.cu           | 127 +++++++++++++++++++++--
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/gdn-conv.cuh          |   8 ++
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/ggml-cuda-try-fuse.cu |   5 +
 4 files changed, 132 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

